		{
			dependencies: ["613DA71A509DC39C"]
			description: [
				"{ftbquests.chapter.voidminer.quest2.description1}"
				""
				"To extract &bitems&r from miner, you can use any &bitem&r pipe or wireless &bitem&r transfer. &bItems&r can only be extracted from the Void Miner; extraction from the frame or any other block is not possible."
				""
				"And you will a lot of &cpower&r, so look at &eSolar Void panels&r, on the other side of this quest chapter! After a few tiers, they become very good sources of &cenergy&r!"
				""
				"&lAnd remember!&r Void miner work only in vanilla minecraft dimensions - Overworld ( Your first dimension ) Nether and End. In other dimensions, like Mining or Lost cities it doesn't work!"
				""
				"Also you &ncan't tick accelerate&r any of Void miner! Blocked in config."
				""
				"Tier 1 - &dRubetine miner"
				"&rOptimal upgrades:"
				""
				"No modifier slots"
				"————————————————————"
				"&b1 item every 1,000 ticks"
				"&r&cPower consume 3,000 RF/t&r"
			]
